Package: ontologyConnectR
Title: Live Source Connectors for Ontology Object Types
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ontology", "Developer", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "dev@example.com")
Description: Backs ontology object types against live external sources
    (REST APIs, FHIR R4, JDBC databases, GraphQL) without data
    materialisation. Queries translate in real time to the source's
    native query language. Integrates with objectSetsR as a drop-in
    replacement for DBI-backed tables.
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    rlang (>= 1.0.0),
    cli (>= 3.0.0),
    cachem (>= 1.0.0),
    jsonlite (>= 1.7.0),
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0)
Suggests:
    DBI,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    httptest2,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    withr
